\nThe intention is to declutter the top-level folder which I'm admittedly pretty territorial about (and @Repiteo seems to be too :D).\r\n\r\nProof of concept for now, this is not the cleanest way to deal with this in SCons (we might want to consider making better use of SCons `tools` like godot-cpp does: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp/tree/master/tools ), but this might be good enough for now.\r\n\r\nI kept the `importlib` modules registered with a non-scoped identifier despite the subfolders, aside from `scu_builders.py` which I consolidated with `misc.utility.color`. This was mainly to avoid having to modify a bunch of platform code to include `platform.platform_methods` instead of `platform_methods`. It also didn't like the circular dependency between `methods.py` and `platform_methods.py` registered as a module, so I tweaked it a bit.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien